3:T431,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is an OCT scan worth the extra money?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For most people over 25, yes. At £10 to £39, an OCT scan can detect sight-threatening conditions years before symptoms appear. It is particularly valuable for anyone with risk factors such as a family history of glaucoma or macular degeneration, or diabetes."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is an OCT scan available on the NHS?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"OCT scanning is not routinely available as part of an NHS sight test. It may be used in hospital eye clinics for patients being monitored for specific conditions. At high-street opticians, it is available as a private add-on."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How often should I have an OCT scan?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Annually is recommended for most people. Having a baseline scan and then comparing against it at each subsequent test allows your optometrist to detect even subtle changes over time."}}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","main",null,{"className":"flex-1","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"name\":\"OCT Scan Cost UK — How Much Is an OCT Eye Scan? (2026 Prices)\",\"description\":\"How much an OCT scan costs at UK opticians in 2026, what it detects, and whether you should add one to your eye test.\",\"url\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk/find/oct-scan-cost\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"eyetest.co.uk\",\"url\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"eyetest.co.uk\",\"url\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk\"},\"dateModified\":\"2026-06-16\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.eyetest.